    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486510/extras/106dea8b807547b8921f66e9c1a7eee9.webp?t=1737507098\" /></span><br><br>Step into the enchanting world of RINBO, where every path unfolds new adventures and delightful discoveries await at every turn.<br><br>Play as Soren, a young Noble driven by rivalry with his twin brother Blue, as they embark on a quest to gain the approval of the enigmatic demon Dorimkasto. <br><br>On their 11th birthday, their journey for ascension begins, leading Soren through diverse landscapes and encounters with otherworldly beings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br>   <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>   <strong>Magical 3D Action-Adventure</strong>: Immerse yourself in thrilling magic and melee combat as you navigate an expansive world.<br></li><li>   <strong>Glide Freely</strong>: Soar through enchanting landscapes without a care, exploring from lively forests to mysterious dungeons.<br></li><li>   <strong>Rich Storytelling</strong>: Unravel the secrets of RINBO through engaging narratives and quirky NPCs across 4 bustling towns.<br></li><li>   <strong>Quests Galore</strong>: Embark on quests, collect rare Moons and gems, and interact with over 100 colorful characters who bring the world to life.<br></li><li>   <strong>Captivating Soundscapes</strong>: Immerse yourself in a soundtrack that shifts from whimsical melodies to pulse-pounding boss themes.<br></li><li>   <strong>Visual Splendor</strong>: Experience toon-style landscapes with surreal, dark fantasy atmospheres that breathe life into every corner of RINBO.</li></ul><br>Prepare for a journey where every decision adds a dash of magic to your adventure. Whether you're exploring for fun, strategy, or pure joy, RINBO promises an experience that will keep you enchanted from start to finish.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486510/extras/d85a3c76fd8ef633b56ccbcbf6b5e85e.avif?t=1737507098\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486510/extras/106dea8b807547b8921f66e9c1a7eee9.webp?t=1737507098\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486510/extras/106dea8b807547b8921f66e9c1a7eee9.webp?t=1737507098\" /></span><br><br>Step into the enchanting world of RINBO, where every path unfolds new adventures and delightful discoveries await at every turn.<br><br>Play as Soren, a young Noble driven by rivalry with his twin brother Blue, as they embark on a quest to gain the approval of the enigmatic demon Dorimkasto. <br><br>On their 11th birthday, their journey for ascension begins, leading Soren through diverse landscapes and encounters with otherworldly beings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br>   <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>   <strong>Magical 3D Action-Adventure</strong>: Immerse yourself in thrilling magic and melee combat as you navigate an expansive world.<br></li><li>   <strong>Glide Freely</strong>: Soar through enchanting landscapes without a care, exploring from lively forests to mysterious dungeons.<br></li><li>   <strong>Rich Storytelling</strong>: Unravel the secrets of RINBO through engaging narratives and quirky NPCs across 4 bustling towns.<br></li><li>   <strong>Quests Galore</strong>: Embark on quests, collect rare Moons and gems, and interact with over 100 colorful characters who bring the world to life.<br></li><li>   <strong>Captivating Soundscapes</strong>: Immerse yourself in a soundtrack that shifts from whimsical melodies to pulse-pounding boss themes.<br></li><li>   <strong>Visual Splendor</strong>: Experience toon-style landscapes with surreal, dark fantasy atmospheres that breathe life into every corner of RINBO.</li></ul><br>Prepare for a journey where every decision adds a dash of magic to your adventure. Whether you're exploring for fun, strategy, or pure joy, RINBO promises an experience that will keep you enchanted from start to finish.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486510/extras/d85a3c76fd8ef633b56ccbcbf6b5e85e.avif?t=1737507098\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486510/extras/106dea8b807547b8921f66e9c1a7eee9.webp?t=1737507098\" /></span>",
